raffic、Engagement、Conversion等指标。\n4. 数据分析与运营管理\n定期输出官网运营及流量分析报告，识别问题并提出优化方案。\n追踪市场、产品、渠道及用户数据，为营销策略和资源投入提供数据支持。\n建立官网内容及运营管理机制，推动跨部门项目高效落地。","Require":"1. 1-2年以上官网运营、Digital Marketing、E-commerce或相关工作经验。\n2. 熟悉Website CMS、GA4、Google Search Console及SEO工具。具备SEO、内容运营、Landing Page及Conversion Rate Optimization经验。对AI Search / GEO发展趋势有了解或实际操作经验。\n3. 具备较强的数据分析及问题解决能力，能够通过数据驱动运营优化。\n4. 具备良好的项目管理及跨部门沟通能力。\n具备英文读写能力，有海外市场/APAC运营经验者优先。\n有消费电子、智能家电、IoT或科技品牌经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"营销类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":"2年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-30T16:10:59","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"afcbb038-ffe4-447e-97ce-579b62540a39","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190874725,"PostDateInt":1793347496000,"PostDate":"2026-10-30T16:04:56","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","Jo